### 1. Anadir piloto
POST http://localhost:8080/dsa/pilots
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "P01", "nombre": "Eric", "apellidos": "Lopez" }

### 2. Anadir dron
POST http://localhost:8080/dsa/drones
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "D01", "nombre": "Halcon", "fabricante": "DJI", "modelo": "Mavic 3" }

### 3. Anadir otro dron
POST http://localhost:8080/dsa/drones
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "D02", "nombre": "Aguila", "fabricante": "Parrot", "modelo": "Anafi" }

### 4. Crear plan de vuelo (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/dsa/flightplans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idDrone": "D01",
  "idPilot": "P01",
  "fecha": "2026-11-10T10:00",
  "horas": 2,
  "posiciones": [
    { "latitude": 41.275, "longitude": 1.987 },
    { "latitude": 41.280, "longitude": 1.990 }
  ]
}

### 5. Mismo plan otra vez (409 conflicto)
POST http://localhost:8080/dsa/flightplans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idDrone": "D01",
  "idPilot": "P01",
  "fecha": "2026-11-10T11:00",
  "horas": 1,
  "posiciones": []
}

### 6. Listado de drones ordenados por horas
GET http://localhost:8080/dsa/drones

### 7. Planes de un piloto
GET http://localhost:8080/dsa/pilots/P01/flightplans

### 8. Planes de un dron
GET http://localhost:8080/dsa/drones/D01/flightplans

### 9. Guardar dron en el almacen
POST http://localhost:8080/dsa/warehouse/D02

### 10. Reparar dron del almacen
PUT http://localhost:8080/dsa/warehouse/repair
